RISKS AND CONTINGENCY PLANS 

List known and potential risks by estimated probability, with mitigation plans. 

Input crash: the program expects an integer, but the user types a letter, crashing the loop 

Mitigation: read all console inputs as strings instead of integers, then convert them safetly using try-catch blocks 

Losing test data on restart 

Inside the program’s main method, create 3 placeholder objects directly into the list to always have data to test with immediately 

 
